     This is one of the three Migne collections, so it carries the
     tome view as well: the same works shelved by the tome they
     were printed in, which is how the Patrologia is cited.
     faith-room.js draws that too. The four rooms that are not cited
     that way do not offer it.

     Generated as a set: if one changes, change them all. --}}

